1
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:37,860
Wifey,

2
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,160
do you know how I spent

3
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,130
the night?

4
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,330
Oh.

5
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:45,160
What did you do?

6
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,730
I sold myself.

7
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:50,330
What?

8
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,960
The divine doctor in the Demon Realm charged 300 spirit stones.

9
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,160
I didn't have a single coin.

10
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,260
So I had to pledge myself to him.

11
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,660
I worked as a coolie for three days.

12
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,800
Serving tea, pouring water, washing clothes, and cooking.

13
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,330
I even bathed his 300-pound demon pig.

14
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,430
That pig even bit me.

15
00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:03,100
Look.

16
00:01:05,099 --> 00:01:06,330
Isn't this a mosquito bite?

17
00:01:06,330 --> 00:01:08,460
That mosquito bit the pig and then came to bite me.

18
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:08,920
Anyway,

19
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:09,530
wifey,

20
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,460
I suffered so much for you.

21
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,930
Shouldn't you comfort me?

22
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:17,260
Why do I feel like you're talking nonsense?

23
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:20,500
Then a kiss will do.

24
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:21,700
Get lost.

25
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:28,230
Hitting means affection, scolding means love.

26
00:01:30,030 --> 00:01:32,560
Is this idiot in front of me really my husband?

27
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,560
How could I fall for such a fool?

28
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:44,130
When was this beautiful courtyard built in the Hundred Flowers Valley?

29
00:01:44,259 --> 00:01:45,729
And hiding a beauty?

30
00:01:47,729 --> 00:01:48,330
Brother,

31
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,400
we're in for a treat tonight.

32
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:55,530
Where does this pig stench come from?

33
00:01:55,530 --> 00:01:58,930
How dare you have improper thoughts about my beautiful wife?

34
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,330
You skinny stick,

35
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:03,230
how dare you block me?

36
00:02:03,860 --> 00:02:06,260
Let me show you how powerful I am.

37
00:02:12,730 --> 00:02:13,390
Bring it on.

38
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,730
What are you doing? Hit them quickly!

39
00:02:24,430 --> 00:02:25,000
Well,

40
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:25,760
wifey,

41
00:02:25,930 --> 00:02:28,530
I actually took a spiritual power pill before.

42
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:33,400
Wifey,

43
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,630
you won't despise me, will you?

44
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:37,000
Why didn't you say so earlier?

45
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,260
Hahaha.

46
00:02:38,930 --> 00:02:40,930
Boss, don't waste words with them.

47
00:02:40,930 --> 00:02:42,660
Let's fill our stomachs first.

48
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:03,260
I did that?

49
00:03:07,730 --> 00:03:09,960
Am I this powerful?

50
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:14,090
Wifey, you actually have such divine skills.

51
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:15,760
Did I really do that?

52
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:16,829
Absolutely true.

53
00:03:17,430 --> 00:03:18,860
Although I, Cang Yuan, am useless,

54
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:20,000
I'm not blind.

55
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:23,990
There's no second person in the Six Realms with your skills, wifey.

56
00:03:38,130 --> 00:03:40,190
What's the background of this woman?

57
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,530
Who exactly am I?

58
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:48,060
Wifey,

59
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,500
you are my wife.

60
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:51,560
Your name is Bai Li.

61
00:03:51,930 --> 00:03:52,730
I am Cang Yuan.

62
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:57,030
We are an immortal couple envied by everyone.

63
00:03:57,860 --> 00:03:59,260
Do I really have amnesia?

64
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:00,830
Yes.

65
00:04:02,860 --> 00:04:04,990
So I must stay by your side all the time.

66
00:04:09,830 --> 00:04:11,230
Wifey, do you despise me?

67
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:16,930
Although...

68
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,860
Although I don't know why I chose you,

69
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:23,220
maybe I'll understand when I remember everything.

70
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,130
It's okay, wifey.

71
00:04:25,730 --> 00:04:27,430
Even if you don't remember anything,

72
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:28,890
you will always be my wife.

73
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:02,760
Leave.

74
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:11,960
You...

75
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:15,160
You're not going to kill me?

76
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,620
If you don't leave now,

77
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:18,300
I'll change my mind.

78
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:31,530
God of War Bai Li,

79
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:34,320
you saved me back then.

80
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:37,290
Now it's my turn to repay the favor.

81
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:39,300
I will definitely

82
00:05:39,659 --> 00:05:41,260
make you fall in love with me.

83
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:43,230
I will

84
00:05:43,659 --> 00:05:44,400
marry you.
